s reference image(s) and wants to transform them via CLI; after an edit prompt has been approved; mentions \"dreamina image2image\", \"图生图CLI\", \"编辑图片\"; provides images and asks to run a transformation; or needs credit checking, task querying, or session management for image editing. This skill covers the complete CLI parameter reference including the critical --images syntax, model version restrictions, 4 standard I2I execution workflows, image file verification patterns, and error handling for common I2I-specific failures. Always use this skill when the user wants to edit images via the dreamina command line.", "downloads": 30, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_c1d16043/jimeng-cli-image2image", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/a4e49550-e527-4406-b761-c4f2e607b757.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "即梦-图生图 CLI 技能，让你的智能体通过 即梦 CLI 生成图片", "ownerName": "user_c1d16043", "score": 2806.361085126286, "slug": "jimeng-cli-image2image", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780198410710, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779588684683, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 30, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_70c2f807/regex-generator-pro", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "正则表达式生成", "ownerName": "user_70c2f807", "score": 11235.955056179775, "slug": "regex-generator-pro", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780198410618, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779560551963, "description": "Build structured medical literature search strategies from natural language research questions using PICO/PEO frameworks with progressive clarification dialogue. Supports funnel-style questioning to transform vague user queries into precise research objectives before generating search strategies. Supports PubMed, Embase, Cochrane Librar